224	    // The Refine colour pick lands here, in ranking — not in candidate building.
225	    // It reorders the shortlist toward the requested families and is dropped
226	    // silently when the closet cannot honour it.
227	    //
228	    // Rank everything, then spread the shortlist across the wardrobe before the
229	    // re-ranker sees it. Taking the top 20 by score alone clusters — a neutral
230	    // top harmonises with everything, so it occupies most of the list, and "the
231	    // best 3" of a clustered list is three versions of one outfit. Diversifying
232	    // the INPUT makes the model's three distinct by construction.
233	    // Season rides along as a ranking preference — in-season combos float to the
234	    // top of the shortlist the re-ranker sees, but an off-season one is still
